{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c5c58e7fe8d73ff9db878ae6cf643e3084721d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x*y=\\frac{x\\cdot y}{x+y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"106\" height=\"36\" />' then\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/0/5209df796f70865bcaac6483e437df1776169b01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } \\text{``*&quot; is commutative but not associative} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"316\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b050444c72185e9009a29c0eb9df1860e1fa0371.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(B) \\ }\\text{``*&quot; is associative but not commutative} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"315\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b44ef8f3b78551633f96bc7575426e16ba5866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(C) \\  } \\text{``*&quot; is neither commutative nor associative} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"377\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee96e7e3f60b24336595674be299598d2fa6e1fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(D) \\  } \\text{``*&quot; is commutative and associative} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"289\" height=\"18\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/2/9a23f93ed335ad1fb4671cff96b1b81601ec4ff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\text{none of these} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, let's check for commutivity. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/4/144ffa2f41a12855644c53fbb76cd0cbb710824b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y*x=\\frac{y\\cdot x}{y+x}=\\frac{x\\cdot y}{x+y}=x*y\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"36\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> is commutative.\n</p><p>Now we check for associativity. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/8058038396e45c0c82addc82b1b6292de87a03b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x*y)*z=\\left(\\frac{x\\cdot y}{x+y}\\right)*z=\\frac{\\frac{x\\cdot y}{x+y}\\cdot z}{\\frac{x\\cdot y}{x+y}+z}=\\frac{x\\cdot y\\cdot z}{x\\cdot y+z(x+y)}=\\frac{x\\cdot y\\cdot z}{x\\cdot y+y\\cdot z+x\\cdot z}.\\]\" width=\"586\" height=\"49\" /> Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/b/f8be0e79766a4e840b681f9a676912da4c868d1e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x*(y*z)=x*\\left(\\frac{y\\cdot z}{y+z}\\right)=\\frac{x\\cdot\\frac{y\\cdot z}{y+z}}{x+\\frac{y\\cdot z}{y+z}}=\\frac{x\\cdot y\\cdot z}{x(y+z)+y\\cdot z}=\\frac{x\\cdot y\\cdot z}{x\\cdot y+y\\cdot z+x\\cdot z}=(x*y)*z ,\\]\" width=\"673\" height=\"49\" /> and so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/4/1e4bb5c0261c8d726157108cdd95cf6eb7bb6d46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$*$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" /> is also associative. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AH